'''''Sun, Repel Stars and Pale Moon''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Before Their Deaths]].

==Steps==
# Explore Janusopolis
# Observe the incident at the Sanctum of Prophecy
# Speak with Aglaea and Tribbie
# (Optional) Chat with other Chrysos Heir subjects
# Meet up with Hysilens
# Participate in the Alliance meeting
# Have an audience with Cerydra
# Chat with Cyrene at the Marmoreal Palace
# "Relax" at the Marmoreal Palace
# Take a stroll around Marmoreal Palace with Cyrene
# Go with Cyrene to prepare for tomorrow's banquet
# Head to the banquet area
# Continue exploring the Marmoreal Palace with Cyrene
# Find a quiet place to "relax" with Cyrene
# Deal with the arrival of new guests

