===Explore Janusopolis{{subst:void|<!--104060401-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Imperator's Janusopolis|People say this is a cruel era stained with golden blood and crimson, an era of catastrophe where tsunamis rage and mountains crumble, an era of tyranny where corrupt rulers trample the law, a dark era where both gods and their faithful are slaughtered. This is the era of the First Flame-Chase Journey, an era with a scorching sun that burns with blinding light.<br />And you must gaze directly into it, asking it to illuminate the fire you seek.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
:{{tx}}
----
:'''Cyrene:''' (Trailblazer)... (Trailblazer)?
:'''Cyrene:''' ...Honestly. You were the one who insisted on reviewing history, yet here you are, dozing off?
:'''Cyrene:''' Wake up! Otherwise, I'll have to...
:'''Cyrene:''' ...Awake at last? I guess I won't have to use my "wake up" magic on you then.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I was meditating.
::'''Cyrene:''' Fine, as you say~ Just "meditating."
::Where... exactly are we?
::Memories are the prelude to dreams...
::'''Cyrene:''' What are you murmuring? Still lost in the past?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Where... exactly are we?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Memories are the prelude to dreams...
::'''Cyrene:''' What are you murmuring? Still lost in the past?
:'''Cyrene:''' We've arrived. A familiar place... the Temple of the Three Fates. If everything went according to plan, it should be shortly after Talanton's fall...
:'''Cyrene:''' And also the end of the first Flame-Chase Journey.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The Law demigod awaits.
::'''Cyrene:''' Indeed. The first Flame-Chase ended with the trial of Law. We must find the demigod and gain her trust before the Coreflame is restored.
::The end? Are we late?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} The end? Are we late?
:'''Cyrene:''' Perfect timing, actually. The first Flame-Chase ended with the trial of Law. We must find the demigod and gain her trust before the Coreflame is restored.
:'''Cyrene:''' It'll be tricky, so let's pick up our pace. To Okhema first. We can learn more from the crowds there...
:'''Angry Priest:''' Tyrant! You and your butchers are not welcome here! Get out!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What's that noise? A dispute?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Careful. Sounds like someone's in there.
:'''Irritable Warrior:''' Hold your tongue! Conspiring with Kremnos and plotting rebellion are crimes punishable by death...
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

