::'''Cyrene:''' The currents of time have become twisted. Regardless of who caused this, that "Imperator" came prepared. We're the ones at a disadvantage now...
::'''Cyrene:''' ...
::'''Cyrene:''' ...(Trailblazer), we might as well dance their dance. Let's go with them to the holy city.
::'''Cyrene:''' We've received the Imperator's favor because of your unique background. As a result, the people of Okhema will certainly respect you more. Just put that to good use, and add a bit of your experience and charm...
::'''Cyrene:''' Should be easier than last time, right? If we figure out what happened in this cycle, we'll be able to turn things back in our favor.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} And old Flame-Chase companions await in the holy city.
