:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Trailblaze: The Sequel &mdash; we always find a way.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Can't do without your charm either.
:::'''Cyrene:''' So I'm the key? Since you insist, (Trailblazer)... I'll give it my all!
