::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Trailblaze: The Sequel &mdash; we always find a way.
::'''Cyrene:''' Calm and confident. That's the (Trailblazer) I'm familiar with.
::'''Hysilens:''' ...Guests, please.
::{{tx}}

