===Have an audience with Cerydra{{subst:void|<!--104060409-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Cerydra)
:'''Cerydra:''' I apologize for that farce of a meeting.
:'''Cyrene:''' It must be tiring, dealing with so many people every day, Great Imperator.
:'''Cerydra:''' Tiring? Hah, you're mistaken.
:'''Cerydra:''' Moving chess pieces, placing wagers... this game of strategy adds a dash of color to our heavy fates, much like how rule and conquest are always accompanied by sacrifice.
:'''Cyrene:''' Is the war with the Titans also part of that sacrifice?
:'''Cerydra:''' Hah, after I glimpsed the secrets of this world... no, the secrets beyond the sky, the divine authority of Amphoreus no longer held any significance.
:'''Cerydra:''' Let me ask you, Deliverer: Is it true that, beyond Amphoreus's sky, there are magnificent deities called "Aeons"?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Aeons exist. That's a fact.
::'''Cerydra:''' Ah... the word "fact" has never been so intoxicating.
::THEIR powers are a thousand times greater than the Titans'.
::'''Cerydra:''' Ah... that certainly captivates my interest.
::Where... did you hear this from?
