:'''Hysilens:''' Yet, you, a golden trout who's always busy all day, suddenly have the time to visit me?
:'''Aglaea:''' Do you think I wanted to come? I suggest you burn some more of the incense offered by our allies, lest my creations be tainted by the reek of fish.
:'''Aglaea:''' I'm only here on the Imperator's behalf to remind you to prepare for the {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|banquet}}.
:'''Hysilens:''' Fine. But I must retort. What you call the "reek of fish," to me, is the unique fragrance of the sea.
:'''Hysilens:''' Besides, if my fine clothes get stained, won't you just gift me new ones?
:'''Aglaea:''' I won't.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} They seem pretty close.
::'''Cyrene:''' You sensed it too, huh?
::There's a strange chemistry between them.
::'''Cyrene:''' Is that how friendship is described beyond the sky? Fascinating.
